OL,3,GNEWSAHow chasing a cat earned rescue
OL,4,Adog top award
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is a tale as old as time - dogs
OL,7,Fchasing cats. But for one very good
OL,8,Fgirl it has led to a national award.
OL,10,FScout, a Staffordshire Bull Terrier,
OL,11,Fwas found abandoned, desperately
OL,12,Funderweight and suffering from severe
OL,13,Fskin problems in Leek, Staffordshire,
OL,14,Fduring the first Covid-19 lockdown.
OL,16,FShe was taken in by Marilyn Gilchrist,
OL,17,Fwho trains dogs to track scents, and
OL,18,Fwithin a few years put her skills to
OL,19,Fuse - helping Gilchrist's friend track
OL,20,Fdown her missing cat, Ripley, who had
OL,21,Fbeen lost for more than a fortnight.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
