OL,3,GNEWSAHow chasing a cat earned rescue
OL,4,Adog top award
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn recognition of her trailing
OL,7,Fabilities, Scout has now been awarded
OL,8,Fthe Service Dogs UK and National
OL,9,FFoundation for Retired Service Animals
OL,10,Fdog medal of honour.
